    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Dungeon Keeper: Labyrinth Legacy, a unique blend of monster farming, ecology management, and dungeon crafting set in an ever-changing roguelike world. As the guardian of a mystical dungeon, your task is to cultivate a diverse ecosystem where monsters thrive and evolve.<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n\u2022\tMonster Farming: Breed and raise a wide array of monsters, each with unique traits and abilities. From zombie to golem, discover rare species and harness their powers.<br />\r\n\u2022\tEcology Management: Balance the needs of your monsters with the health of your dungeon\u2019s ecosystem. Ensure that every creature plays a role in a thriving environment, influencing growth and evolution in real-time.<br />\r\n\u2022\tDungeon Crafting: Design and expand your own dungeon. Create complex labyrinths filled with monster that defend your realm from intruding adventurers.<br />\r\n\u2022\tRoguelike Adventures: No two playthroughs are the same. Dynamic environments make each venture into the depths a unique challenge.<br />\r\n\u2022\tStrategic Battles: Deploy your monsters in tactical battles against would-be heroes. Combine abilities to turn the tide of combat and protect your dungeon\u2019s heart.<br />\r\nDive into ' Dungeon Keeper: Labyrinth Legacy' and shape the fate of your very own monster sanctuary!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Dungeon Keeper: Labyrinth Legacy, a unique blend of monster farming, ecology management, and dungeon crafting set in an ever-changing roguelike world. As the guardian of a mystical dungeon, your task is to cultivate a diverse ecosystem where monsters thrive and evolve.<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n\u2022\tMonster Farming: Breed and raise a wide array of monsters, each with unique traits and abilities. From zombie to golem, discover rare species and harness their powers.<br />\r\n\u2022\tEcology Management: Balance the needs of your monsters with the health of your dungeon\u2019s ecosystem. Ensure that every creature plays a role in a thriving environment, influencing growth and evolution in real-time.<br />\r\n\u2022\tDungeon Crafting: Design and expand your own dungeon. Create complex labyrinths filled with monster that defend your realm from intruding adventurers.<br />\r\n\u2022\tRoguelike Adventures: No two playthroughs are the same. Dynamic environments make each venture into the depths a unique challenge.<br />\r\n\u2022\tStrategic Battles: Deploy your monsters in tactical battles against would-be heroes. Combine abilities to turn the tide of combat and protect your dungeon\u2019s heart.<br />\r\nDive into ' Dungeon Keeper: Labyrinth Legacy' and shape the fate of your very own monster sanctuary!",
    "short_description": "Dungeon Keeper: Labyrinth Legacy is a dynamic tower defense. Develop your dungeon and create monsters to guard your territory against adventurers.",
